						<ProtectedString name="Source">--owen0202 &amp; Golly 
&#9;--[[ ANIMATIONS: (update this list, pl0x)
&#9;&#9;&#9;--&quot;test_Anim&quot; : Arm flicks forwards then back, for testing only
&#9;&#9;&#9;--&quot;sword_Slash1&quot; : A fairly basic sword slash

&#9;&#9;&#9;--&quot;staff_Slam1&quot; : Slams staff onto ground. &quot;You shall not pass!&quot;
&#9;&#9;&#9;--&quot;staff_Hold1&quot; : Holds staff into air (for charging) Waits for &quot;staff_Release&quot; to end
&#9;&#9;&#9;--&quot;staff_Release&quot; Ends &quot;staff_Hold1&quot; animation track
&#9;&#9;&#9;--&quot;drink_1&quot; : &quot;Glug glug glug&quot;
&#9;&#9;&#9;--&quot;drink_2&quot; : &quot;Just let me run this under some warm water..&quot;

